# Windsurf Cascade Rules

All project conventions live in `AGENTS.md` — it is the single source of truth.
This file is intentionally short to prevent rule drift between agents.

On session start:
1. Read `AGENTS.md` (session ritual, core rules, documentation map).
2. Read `.ai/JOURNAL.md` (latest 3-5 entries) to learn what just happened.
3. Read the "Đang Dở / In Progress" section of `.ai/TASKS.md` and continue that work.

On session end:
Check `.ai/rules/definition-of-done.md`, update `.ai/TASKS.md`, and append an entry to `.ai/JOURNAL.md`.
